  "review": {
    "images": "Two Nakheel project-site renders and six native developer brochure renders from the named broker mirror. The developer-hosted edition is https://www.nakheel.com/docs/nakheelcorporatelibraries/nakheel-project-document/como-residences.pdf?sfvrsn=e68ef7f_1. Its reproduction notice is recorded for the final handoff. These assets are used for local review.",
    "location": "The short link in Nakheel’s corporate project page resolves to 25.110875, 55.1458512. The location uses that interactive marker and five time estimates from the same project page. The mall rename is confirmed at https://www.dubaiholding.com/en/media-hub/press-releases/dubai-holding-asset-management-announces-dubai-retail-as-the-unified-brand-for-its-malls-and-lifestyle-destinations. The original three-minute Palm Monorail estimate was omitted because the operator reports suspended service at https://www.palmmonorail.com/.",
    "floorPlans": "Physical pages 2–32 of the 33-page Nakheel plan book are the 31 full residence sheets. Separate upper sheets match the unit numbers on the lower sheets that provide whole-residence areas. Page 25 prints 9,297.00–9,346.00 sq ft alongside 892.05–918.75 sq m. The units do not convert consistently. The selector shows the printed sq ft as published, with the complete unedited panel available for review. Some grouped area endpoints are published ranges, so their bounds should not be added together to calculate a unit total."
  },
